<title>USA: CDW Computer to expand sales force.</title>
<headline>CDW Computer to expand sales force.</headline>
<dateline>BUFFALO GROVE, Ill. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>CDW Computer Centers Inc, a direct marketer of computer products, on Thursday it was expanding its sales force and marketing activities to reach more prospective customers.</p>
<p>CDW said its marketing efforts drove first-quarter growth despite a three percent decline in the average order size compared with the same period last year.</p>
<p>The company said first-quarter net income rose to $0.52 a share from $0.26 in the 1996 quarter, or $0.55 versus $0.35 a share on a pro forma basis. Sales rose to $297.78 million from $206.71 million.</p>
</text>
